{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/wall.png?t=1769042900\" /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0Welcome to the world of <strong>Now THAT'S a Big Dragon!</strong>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/wall.png?t=1769042900\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home kingdom is in danger, and it's up to you to recruit and expand an ever-growing band of brave warriors, wizards, and all sorts of adventurers who relentlessly attack a single, gigantic dragon. The game is a numbers-driven idle experience: buy more troops, upgrade their power, automate your economy, and click the dragon yourself for bonus damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/d2d298b1f3c6d8debe66a6f9309957f8.poster.avif?t=1769042900\" width=240 height=142 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/d2d298b1f3c6d8debe66a6f9309957f8.webm?t=1769042900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/d2d298b1f3c6d8debe66a6f9309957f8.mp4?t=1769042900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game expands on the idle incremental genre while keeping its most important feature: NUMBERS... GOING... UP! \u2b06\ufe0f \u2b06\ufe0f \u2b06\ufe0f \u2b06\ufe0f \u2b06\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/features_banner.png?t=1769042900\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you'll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple currencies/resources: Grow your gold, wood, iron and food.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple characters: Automation now has a face and different skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: Plenty of options to boost your actions and automation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy: Different upgrades or characters affect the progress or power of other game elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An enemy that fights back: Protect yourself from the dragon's roar, and fire attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has an ending: Feel the relief of saving your kingdom and ending the crisis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has a new beginning: Revisit the game with new modifiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/extras/steam_ss_1.png?t=1769042900\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s time for you to pack your gear and join the adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: Some of the features listed above are still in development and may not be available in the demo version of the game.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834590?t=1769042900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/cebdac9971116f79a425a728a189a951d37ec5be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769042900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/db51c890a83003dbbffc54bd84a8f75a029dd700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769042900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834590/db51c890a83003dbbffc54bd84a8f75a029dd700/ca